
                                                                                            KEY DRM MONITOR


* Problem Overview
Accessing copyrighted content requires a DRM (Digital Rights Management) key. However, DRM keys must be purchased — which directly affects the budget, operational costs, and overall profitability.

* Optimization Strategy
To minimize expenses, it's crucial to determine the optimal number of DRM keys needed:
Example: For a user base of 2 million, purchasing only ¼ of the total (i.e., 500,000 DRM keys) may be sufficient.

This approach helps reduce licensing costs while maintaining adequate access for active users.

* Business Department (BD) Use Case
The Business Department (BD) needs to calculate the DRM key budget for the upcoming quarter. To do this effectively, they require:

   Statistics on DRM key issuance

   Usage analytics of DRM keys

These insights will help BD propose a cost-effective and data-driven budget for DRM licensing.
